<title>UK: Amersham sees 30 mln stg savings from merger.</title>
<headline>Amersham sees 30 mln stg savings from merger.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amersham International Plc said on Tuesday that the merger of its Life Science operation would generate savings of more than 30 million stg over the next three years.</p>
<p>Ron Long, who will become chief executive of officer of the merged company, Amersham Pharmacia Biotech, told Reuters he expected savings of 3.0 million stg this year, 20 million stg in year two and 30 million stg in the third year.</p>
</text>
